# Q38 offline evidence: let the IPC reader wait instead of dropping frames
# Loopback only. No radio/AWDL/USB/air interface/iPhone. 2026-10-28 (UTC+8).

## change
deliver_ip_packet() now retries g_netif.input() on ERR_MEM (1 ms steps, 500 ms bound)
instead of dropping the frame. tcpip_inpkt() leaves the pbuf owned by the caller on
failure, so the same pbuf is re-posted; the reader thread is the only producer, so
blocking it is end-to-end backpressure towards awdld. New counter input_retry.

